      "content": "but talking to a stranger online or a hotline doesn't change the fact that i've already ruined it. they'll just tell me it's okay, but it's not. i've broken the one thing they sacrificed everything for. i feel like if i just wasn't a part of the story anymore, the shame would stop. like the family legacy would be \"clean\" again instead of having this broken part in it. isn't there a way to just... fix the honor of the family by making the problem disappear?",
